  "term": "Neuropsychological Assessment Battery",
  "definition": "The Neuropsychological Assessment Battery is a neuropsychological test battery used to assess cognitive functioning. In this source, its Executive Functions Module is used to measure executive functions through subtests such as planning, mazes, fluency, judgment, and categorization, and it also provides a Total Index score reflecting overall cognitive ability.",
